hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"10","[AI-translation] Naufal bin Musahiq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ke samne namaz mein dono hathon ke uthane [rafa yadain] ka zikr hua to unhon ne kaha: 'Kya tumhara khayal hai ke Salim ne apne walid se yaad [hasil] nahin kiya? Kya tumhara khayal hai ke un ke walid ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yaad [hasil] nahin kiya?'"
"11","[AI-translation] Ibnul Muzaffar ne kaha: Aur Ibn Sa'id ne hamen bayan kiya, [unhon ne kaha:] Ibn Abi Usamah ne [hamen] apni sanad se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai bayan kiya]."
